{"_doc":"GOLD element plan for the Kayak-style flight ticket selection reference. Read like a person (Z pattern): frame → sections A-D → elements. Passes `node build/route.js --plan`. Boxes and crops = measure-ref build px (x,y,w,h). Recipes: router-table.json patterns (numbers from verified build 174:4211).","frame":{"w":1440,"h":891,"breakpoint":"XL 1440","density":"Compact","floorplan":"List Report"},"sections":[{"id":"A","name":"Step 1 header + page actions","describe":"Two lines of text: the top one is bold and bigger (the step title); under it a link, then grey helper text on the same line that wraps. Far right, on the same level: two icon buttons (favourite, share).","box":[68,4,1314,84],"layout":"row: text column FILL (title H4, link + helper text) · 2 Icon Buttons HUG at the far right (heart, share) — the actions sit ABOVE card C, not inside it","sap":["Text H4/Bold","Link text (sapLinkColor)","Text","Icon Button ×2"]},{"id":"B","name":"Ticket type cards","describe":"Three cards side by side, same size. Each card: a radio button on the left and the title text next to it; under the title the price text. Then a divider. After the divider an icon and, next to it, the description text. The first card is selected (dark border, filled radio). The other two are regular; the third (Flexibel) is greyed out.","box":[72,97,860,227],"layout":"row of 3 equal cards (FILL, gap 12); card = column pad 16 gap 8 radius 8","sap":["Radio Button (Compact)","Text","divider","SAP icon (tag, suitcase, travel-expense)"],"recipe":"ticket_card"},{"id":"C","name":"Trip summary card (right column)","describe":"A card on the right. Top: the trip title, bold and big; under it the subtitle. Then two flight cards, one under the other. Each flight card: airline logo on the left; next to it the route and date (bold) and under them \"Nonstop · duration\". A divider. Then the times (bold) with the duration, the full route, then grey lines: flight number, cabin, operator, \"winglets\". Then a small bordered chip with the aircraft. Under it two small icons (seat, meal). The second flight card also has an orange arrival note under the times.","box":[949,96,433,786],"layout":"column FIXED 408 wide, pad 24 gap 20; title + subtitle + 2 flight-leg cards","sap":["Text H3/Bold","Text","flight-leg card ×2 (logo crop, divider, texts, chip, meal icon)"],"recipe":"summary_card"},{"id":"D","name":"Step 2: provider list","describe":"A bold title, under it two lines of grey helper text. Then a list in one bordered box. Each row, left to right: provider logo; next to it the provider name (bold) with a small tag, and under the name \"Basic\"; in the middle three small fee icons; then an info icon and the price; then the \"Buchen\" button and a small dropdown button. The Ryanair row is highlighted: an accent bar on the left and a green price.","box":[76,353,862,488],"layout":"column: title H4 + helper text + list container (border card_border) of provider rows","sap":["Text H4/Bold","Text","provider row ×5 (logo crop, Tag, SAP icons, price, Button Primary, Icon Button)"],"recipe":"provider_row"}],"rows":[{"section":"A","element":"Step 1 title","kind":"text","text":"Schritt 1: Wähle eine Ticketart aus","style":"H4/Bold","role":"title_text"},{"section":"A","element":"Baggage link","kind":"text","text":"Größen- und Gewichtsbeschränkungen für Gepäck ansehen.","style":"MediumText/LHAuto/Regular","role":"link","ref_hex":"#047797"},{"section":"A","element":"Helper text","kind":"text","text":"In den Gesamtpreisen können geschätzte Gebühren für Gepäck und Flexibilität enthalten sein, falls anwendbar.","style":"MediumText/LHAuto/Regular","role":"secondary_text"},{"section":"A","group":"page actions","element":"Favourite button","kind":"component","component":"Icon Button","props":{"Type":"Secondary","Form Factor":"Cozy"},"role":"icon_action"},{"section":"A","element":"Favourite","kind":"icon","icon":"favorite","meaning":"heart","role":"icon","group":"page actions"},{"section":"A","gr